  1397                              <1> ; and the curr dir contains the directory copy of the previously successfully 
  1398                              <1> ; searched for file, which is bogus for us here since find file doesnt set up 
  1399                              <1> ; the curDirCopy for the root dir unless we are explicitly searching for it.
  1400 0000448A 85C0                <1>     test eax, eax   ;If the parent dir is null, proceed
  1401 0000448C 740D                <1>     jz .sfdsDirSkip
