     3                              <1> ;-----------------------------------:
     4                              <1> ;  Memory related Kernel routines   :
     5                              <1> ;-----------------------------------:
     6                              <1> ;NOTE: 
     7                              <1> ;   If less than 6 paragraphs requested for alloc, allocate 6 paragraphs.
